    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d131">

                <pb facs="0181" n="169" sameAs="frus:frus1945v08/pg169"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">103.9166: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Greece</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >MacVeagh</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Athens</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-10-07">October 7,
                        1945</date>.<lb/>[Received October 7—12:46 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1129. For Hunt Carroll OWI from Dickson as Astra 6.… Morning papers October 6
                    announced decision Govt hold elections <pb facs="0182" n="170" xml:id="pg170"/>
                    January 20. First press reactions Populists jubilant, Liberals, EAM, Communists
                    bitterly critical. Abstention from elections threatened by Liberals,
                    Progressives, Agrarians and Socialists in addition Communists already committed
                    this stand. Nationalist parties of ex-Liberal Gonatas, Papandreou, Alexandris
                    supporting Populists.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>[Dickson]</item>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">MacVeagh</hi>
                            </item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
